<title>USA: Boise Cascade Q1 shr loss $0.51 vs profit.</title>
<headline>Boise Cascade Q1 shr loss $0.51 vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>BOISE, Idaho 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>BOISE CASCADE CORPORATION INCOME SUMMARY</p>
<p>				(unaudited)</p>
<p> Three months ended March 31	     1997		 1996</p>
<p> Sales				$1,273,610,000   $1,227,600,000</p>
<p> Net income (loss)		  (15,210,000)	 25,510,000</p>
<p>Net income (loss) per common share</p>
<p>   Primary				     (.51)		  .32</p>
<p>   Fully diluted			     (.51)		  .30</p>
<p> Average primary shares	     48,512,000	 48,400,000</p>
<p> Average fully diluted shares     48,512,000	 53,403,000</p>
<p>The computation of fully diluted net loss for the three months ended March 31, 1997, was antidilutive; therefore, the amounts reported for primary and fully diluted loss are the same.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
